00:55:23.970 --> 00:55:28.530
<v Valerie Kipnis>Amerikanskaya zhyzh, meaning America nonsense.
<v Valerie Kipnis>“Amerikanskaya zhyzh”，意思是美国垃圾。

00:55:28.530 --> 00:55:33.530
